---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shutter Scotland | See Edinburgh Differently">
	<main>
		<!-- Hero Section Blueprint -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 border-b border-punk-black">
			
			<!-- Left Pillar: The Manifesto Copy -->
			<div class="md:col-span-5 p-6 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black">
				<div class="space-y-6">
					<span class="font-mono-clean text-xs uppercase bg-punk-black text-punk-white px-2 py-0.5 tracking-widest">MANIFESTO_01</span>
					<h1 class="font-sans-heavy text-5xl md:text-7xl uppercase tracking-tighter text-punk-black leading-none">
						SEE EDINBURGH <br><span class="text-punk-accent">DIFFERENTLY.</span>
					</h1>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-12 md:mt-0">
					<p class="font-mono-clean text-sm text-punk-grey max-w-md leading-relaxed">
    [CONSTRAINTS] Most city tours hand you a history lecture. Most photography sites sell you a print. Shutter Scotland does something else. 
</p>
<p class="font-mono-clean text-sm text-punk-black font-bold max-w-md leading-relaxed mt-4">
    We step off the beaten track, hunt down the overlooked architecture, and show you how to turn raw city texture into sharp, striking street photography. Whether you are using a DSLR or a smartphone, it is time to kill the cliché postcards.
</p>
					<div class="mt-8">
						<a href="/portfolio" class="inline-block font-mono-clean text-xs font-bold uppercase border-heavy border-punk-black bg-punk-accent text-punk-white px-5 py-3 hover:bg-punk-black transition-colors tracking-wider">
							[LOCK IN A ROUTE]
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Right Pillar: Massive Hero Space -->
			<div class="md:col-span-7 bg-punk-black relative group aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-auto min-h-[400px] md:min-h-0">
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-punk-grey opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 z-10"></div>
				<img 
					src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605538032432-a9f0c8d9baac?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200" 
					alt="Gritty Architectural Shadows" 
					class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
				/>
				<div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-punk-black border border-punk-white text-punk-white font-mono-clean text-[10px] uppercase px-2 py-1 z-20 tracking-widest opacity-80">
					LOC_EDINBURGH_OLD_TOWN
				</div>
			</div>

		</section>

		<!-- Sub-Hero Tactical Split: The SB7 Promise -->
		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 font-mono-clean text-sm border-b border-punk-black">
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">01 // COMMAND YOUR CAMERA</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Ditch the auto mode framework. Take complete mathematical and creative control over exposure, depth, and structural dynamics.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">02 // HUNT THE SHADOWS</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Learn to read urban geometry. We bypass the crowded lookout spots to target raw textures, brutal horizons, and slick contrasts.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-3">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black">03 // OWN THE ARTWORK</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey">Stop filling your phone storage with digital noise. Finish the walk with custom-framed, gallery-grade captures that look distinctively yours.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</MainLayout>
